<title>FRANCE: Juppe to meet Renault head today - paper.</title>
<headline>Juppe to meet Renault head today - paper.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Prime Minister Alain Juppe is expected to meet Renault head Louis Schweitzer later on Wednesday afternoon, daily Le Monde said.</p>
<p>It said that Juppe had been informed since mid-January of the carmaker's restructuring plans, but had not wanted to get involved until now.</p>
<p>The prime minister's office had no immediate comment.</p>
</text>
